# Island lane bank through its real caller IslandLaneRolloverControl1 (pirates_winds.cpp:374-378 -> IslandLaneRollover
# :151-170), which takes three branches: top light v_lite538 off -> tabb44 sound, ScorePart, light the top;
# top on and bottom v_lite541 off -> light the bottom and call IslandLaneBank (pirates_awards.cpp:243-257); both on -> flash, tabb44,
# ScorePart. IslandLaneBank 0x429ef0: not all six lit -> sound tabb44 (id 30) and ScorePart(0); all six lit (groups report 3 each)
# -> fathom reset-and-on, multiplier = count + 1, sound tabb88 (id 60), ScorePart(1).
# Real-caller sequence: event 1 lights the top lane (+1,200 = the part's row 0 score, no bank call); event 2
# lights the bottom lane and runs the bank, not full (sound 30, +1,200, multiplier 1); the other four lights are poked on and the
# bottom light poked off, then event 3 takes the bottom branch again and the bank is full: multiplier 2, sound 60, +20,000 x 2.
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init dump_period 10
init watch v_lite538.light_on
init watch v_lite541.light_on
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
150 event a_roll12 ControlCollision
151 expect v_lite538.light_on == 1
151 expect multiplier == 1
151 expect n_score == 1200
150-151 expect sound 30  # tabb44 (top lane)
160 event a_roll12 ControlCollision
161 expect v_lite541.light_on == 1
161 expect multiplier == 1
161 expect n_score == 2400
160-161 expect sound 30  # tabb44 (bank not full)
170 poke v_lite539 light_on 1
170 poke v_lite540 light_on 1
170 poke v_lite542 light_on 1
170 poke v_lite543 light_on 1
170 poke v_lite541 light_on 0
200 event a_roll12 ControlCollision
201 expect multiplier == 2
200-201 expect sound 60  # tabb88 (bank full)
201 expect n_score == 42400  # 2,400 + 20,000 x multiplier 2 (score table row 2)
240 quit
